vatar": "7ed3ebc96026c9fce3a1db70ee772dd3b67cb636"}, "language": "english", "review": "Robots. Must I say more?\r\n\r\nYes? Okay, fine.\r\n\r\nThis is a FPS Roguelike where you progress through stages, riddling various robots with bullet holes, getting perks as you level up, picking up and upgrading different weapons as you progress. Discover secret logs to delve into the game's lore, unlock different classes and more permanent buffs, and find gadgets that, with enough skill, have the potential to make the movement in this game rival Pilot movement in Titanfall 2. No, there's no wallrunning, but trust me.\r\n\r\nMy only complaint is that sometimes I wish this game supported co-op for more than just 2 players, but even then that's not that big of a deal.\r\n\r\nOverall a 10/10 game. Very addicting gameplay that'll get you saying, \"One more game.\"", "timestamp_created": 1723737647, "timestamp_updated": 1723737647, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}]}